ShortDescription: Fast, reading-first code viewer and git review tool.
Description: Lector is built for reading and reviewing code rather than typing it - understanding an unfamiliar codebase, following definitions, and reviewing changes made by people or AI agents. Syntax highlighting, symbol navigation, project search, side-by-side diffs, review checklists, history graph and blame.
Moniker: lector
